"entity": {
"name": "Wienerberger AG",
"description": "Wienerberger AG engages in the provision of building materials solutions. which offers bricks, roof tiles, concrete pavers, and pipe systems. It operates through Europe East, Europe West, and North America segments. The Europe East segment provides all system solutions, except for fa\u00e7ades. The Europe West segment offers solutions for the monitoring of water and energy infrastructure and for the optimization of building operations. The North America segment provides ceramic fa\u00e7ade and pipe solutions for residential and commercial construction projects. The company was founded by Alois Miesbach in 1819 and is headquartered in Vienna, Austria.",
